[36m(TaskRunner pid=2489990)[0m     "Clue 2 then ties Bob directly to the house two positions to the right of the very tall person, so Bob must be in house 4.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2489990)[0m     "S2: Bob == 4.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2489990)[0m     "Clue 3 gives us another concrete placement: the super tall person must be in house 1.",
