[36m(TaskRunner pid=2489990)[0m     "S6: short == 3.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2489990)[0m     "Clue 7 tells us that the short person cannot be in the first house (Clue 6) and cannot be in the third house (Clue 7), so the short person must be in house 1.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2489990)[0m     "S7: short == 1.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2489990)[0m     "Since the short person is in house 1 and Alice is the tall person (Clue 10), Alice must be in house 3.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2489990)[0m     "S8: Alice == 3.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2489990)[0m     "Clue 12 introduces a new constraint: there are two houses between the super tall person and Eric, so the super tall person must be in house 1 and Eric in house 4.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2489990)[0m     "S9: super_tall == 1.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2489990)[0m     "Since the super tall person is in house 1 and the very short person is in house 5 (Clue 4), the tall person must be in house 2.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2489990)[0m     "S10: tall == 2.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2489990)[0m     "Since the tall person is in house 2 and Eric is already in house 2 (Clue 4), Eric must be the tall person.",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2489990)[0m     "S11: Eric == tall.",
